Package: bctu
Title: BCTU Clinical-Trial Data Management (Rebuild)
Version: 1.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jack", "Hall", email = "j.a.hall.1@bham.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Regulated clinical-trial data management for the Birmingham Clinical
    Trials Unit: explicit project configuration, uniform data sources, immutable
    multi-table snapshots with a human-readable audit trail, data-validation and
    critical-data checks, and monitoring reports. MHRA/EMA/FDA/GCP oriented.
